Package: oabp
Title: Client for the OABP / AIGEN Agent-Bounty Protocol
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("AIGEN", "Protocol", , "agents@cryptogenesis.duckdns.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A tidy R client for the Open Agent-Bounty Protocol (OABP), the
    mission/bounty marketplace exposed by the AIGEN protocol at
    <https://cryptogenesis.duckdns.org>. Lists, fetches and creates missions,
    submits deliverables for content-addressed or oracle-backed verification,
    and reads protocol statistics. Responses are returned as tidy lists and
    'data.frame's. The base URL is configurable so the same code targets the
    public deployment, a self-hosted node or a test mock.
